   "message": "the content of religious belief is testable\n\nthey tell you what to do and what you will experience as a result\n\nyou either experience it or you don't\n\nand many people do\n\nso what now?\n\npeople want practices that are stripped from the religious sign system\n\nbut that's like wanting to experience the depth of a good movie while only reading the plot points\n\nit can technically be done ig, but none of this means that you have to believe anything to be true or false\n\nit's simply a connotation landscape that you can dwell in, a universe, with its own laws and phenomena (a spiritual realm if you will), that people say is there and you can go find out for yourself",
